{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51136","headline":"辽左雪中登楼 · 许敬宗","name":"辽左雪中登楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁杪崇朝雪，天涯绝塞城。\n冻云连海色，枯木助风声。\n怀古情无已，登楼赋未成。\n梅花南国思，笛里暮愁生。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》一七四《奉天府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}